    {
      "name": "luna_eclipse",
      "id": 5225,
      "name_zh": "月蚀",
      "name_en": "Eclipse",
      "description_zh": "召唤一次月蚀，以她当前技能等级的月光随机打击附近敌人。月光只有伤害效果，不会造成眩晕，而且单一目标只能受到有限次数的打击。月蚀会暂时将白天变为黑夜。",
      "description_en": "Showers random nearby enemies with strikes from Luna's current level of Lucent Beam. These beams do not stun their targets, and there is a maximum number of times that a single target can be struck. Also turns day into night for a short time.",
      "notes_zh": [
        "如果露娜没有升级月光，月蚀将无法造成伤害，但是变为黑夜效果有效。",
        "露娜阵亡后月光马上中止。",
        "不能伤害隐身单位。",
        "每道月光之间都有%beam_interval%秒的间隔。神杖升级后间隔为%beam_interval_scepter%秒。"
      ],
      "notes_en": [
        "Eclipse doesn't work if Luna doesn't have any points in Lucent Beam.",
        "Beams will stop if Luna is killed.",
        "Will not hit invisible units.",
        "There is a %beam_interval% seconds gap between beams, %beam_interval_scepter% seconds with scepter."
      ],
      "source_collection": "abilities",
      "source_pointer": "/result/data/heroes/0/abilities/4",
      "innate": false,
      "granted_by_scepter": false,
      "granted_by_shard": false,
      "upgrade_text": {
        "scepter_loc": {
          "en": "Allows Luna to cast Eclipse on an allied unit or herself and have its effects follow them, or cast it on an area. Increases total beams, reduces duration, removes the limit on beams per unit, and makes the beams appear twice as fast.",
          "zh": "露娜可以对友方单位或自身施放月蚀，使月蚀的效果跟随目标，或者对一片区域施放。增加月光数量，减少月蚀持续时间，并且移除单体打击次数上限，月光的产生间隔缩短一半。"
        },
